# Node.js / Express (detect: `express` in `package.json` && !`next`)

- Surface `backend`. Follow router/middleware structure — no invented framework.
- Input = validate (zod/joi/express-validator if present). SQL/NoSQL = parameterized/ORM only.
- AuthZ = Identity+Role in middleware. Cookie session → CSRF/SameSite as appropriate.
- Errors = centralized handler. Secrets = env — no hardcode.
- Test = `jest`/`vitest`/`mocha` if present per Testing Gate (`07`). If NestJS-specific structure found, Express rules do not apply — Clarify or follow Nest pattern.
